# Metadata used by GitHub ("Cite this repository") and by Zenodo.
# Before each release: set `version` and `date-released`, and add the DOI
# of the release once Zenodo has minted it.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use QALMA in your research, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "QALMA: Quantum Algebras for Lattice Models and Applications"
abstract: >-
  QALMA is a Python library that connects ALPS model and lattice definitions
  with QuTiP quantum objects. It provides an algebraic representation of
  many-body operators and states, mean-field approximations, and Max-Ent
  projected evolution for lattice systems.
